{"reviewId": "254854030_85EPnVYP3", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "举例：\n终端（汽车4S店）某周因促销多卖10辆SUV（偶然因素），担心后续缺车，向车企追加5辆订单（共订15辆）。车企收到15辆订单，判断需求回暖，为保产能向钢厂多订20吨钢材（比常规多10吨）。钢厂接到超额钢材订单，认为需求暴涨，向矿山增订30吨铁矿石（叠加安全库存与生产批量，比实际需求多20 吨）。矿山看到订单激增启动扩产计划，待新产能落地，终端促销结束需求回落，矿山、钢厂库存积压，铁矿石与钢材价格大幅下跌。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "当供应链上的各节点企业只根据来自其相邻的下级企业的需求信息进行生产或者供应决策时，需求信息的不真实性会沿着供应链逆流而上，产生逐级放大的现象。", "range": "10882-10953", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "254854030_85EPnVYP3", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1766648004, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 175, "likes": [{"userVid": 30024227, "name": "粒子", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJjA8OG4ySp65egVYmdicTeYVWzYOY0DcNNIFLZCu8WibXcCH4BAkpHCwNaia4FibR8OkaVGdDLiaNM1S2HDHmbNUibiaNd9Q8tsvicQJURK0EycHic8icQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "粒子", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20250616-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周